indexing and B × 1 × K candidate shapes.', 'Training-positive ranking remains 
vulnerable to memorization and repeated-item shortcuts. Record whether targets 
already occur in their visible prefixes and report repeat-target versus 
novel-target strata. Neither strong nor weak training-panel results establish 
