that these diagnostics guide validation improvements; approximately 5–6/10 is 
better supported. Difficulty 3/10 may underestimate adapter verification, sparse
text retrieval, catalog scoring and missingness handling; approximately 4–5/10 
is more credible. No additional independently trained predictor is needed.'], 
